{"ref":"BDB, נֶ֫תֶק","hw":"נֶ֫תֶק","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">נֶ֫תֶק</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:32\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.32\">Lv 13:32</a></sup> <strong>scab</strong>, an eruption of skin, on head or in beard, causing suspicion of leprosy <strong>(</strong>lit. <em>a tearing off</em>, i.e. what one is inclined to scratch or tear away, cf. <em>scabies</em> from <em>scabere</em>, <em>Krätze</em> from <em>kratzen</em>, etc., v. Di <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:30\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.30\">Lv 13:30</a><strong>)</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">נ׳</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:30\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.30\">Lv 13:30</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:32\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.32\">32</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:33\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.33\">33</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:34\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.34\">34</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:35\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.35\">35</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:36\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.36\">36</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:37\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.37\">37</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <span dir=\"rtl\">נָתֶ֑ק</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 14:54\" href=\"/Leviticus.14.54\">14:54</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">נֶגַע הַנֶּתֶק</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:31\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.31\">13:31</a><sup>(×2)</sup> (all P).","next":"BDB, נָתַר","prev":"BDB, נָתַק"}